{"id":"amnon","name":"Amnon","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:amnon"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Amnon","text":"Faithful. (1.) One of the sons of Shammai, of the children of Ezra (1 Chr. 4:20; comp. 17). (2.) The eldest son of David, by Ahinoam of Jezreel (1 Chr. 3:1; 2 Sam. 3:2). Absalom caused him to be put to death for his great crime in the matter of Tamar (2 Sam. 13:28, 29)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H550","lemma":"אַמְנוֹן","xlit":"ʼAmnôwn","gloss":"Amnon , a son of David","kjv":"Amnon","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H3159","lemma":"יִזְרְעֵאלִית","xlit":"Yizrᵉʻêʼlîyth","gloss":"a Jezreelitess","kjv":"Jezreelitess","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H293","lemma":"אֲחִינֹעַם","xlit":"ʼĂchîynôʻam","gloss":"Achinoam, the name of two Israelitesses","kjv":"Ahinoam","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H2275","lemma":"חֶבְרוֹן","xlit":"Chebrôwn","gloss":"Chebron, a place in Palestine, also the name of two Isra","kjv":"Hebron","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H1060","lemma":"בְּכוֹר","xlit":"bᵉkôwr","gloss":"firstborn","kjv":"eldest, firstborn","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H3205","lemma":"יָלַד","xlit":"yâlad","gloss":"to bear young","kjv":"bear, beget, birth, born","count":2,"share":0.5}],"verses":["2Sam.3.2","1Chr.3.1","1Chr.4.20","2Sam.13.0"],"related":[{"id":"fratricide","type":"lexical","strong":"H550","why":"both lead with אַמְנוֹן (H550)"},{"id":"rape","type":"lexical","strong":"H550","why":"both lead with אַמְנוֹן (H550)"},{"id":"seduction","type":"lexical","strong":"H550","why":"both lead with אַמְנוֹן (H550)"},{"id":"tamar","type":"lexical","strong":"H550","why":"both lead with אַמְנוֹן (H550)"},{"id":"abigail","type":"lexical","strong":"H3159","why":"both lead with יִזְרְעֵאלִית (H3159)"},{"id":"ahinoam","type":"lexical","strong":"H3159","why":"both lead with יִזְרְעֵאלִית (H3159)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":10,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntVII.8","count":9,"b